{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting and erasing ropes...that's all there is to this pure puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/e0f2f545599fe602a3645f3f0d64cdd6.poster.avif?t=1774384440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/e0f2f545599fe602a3645f3f0d64cdd6.webm?t=1774384440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/e0f2f545599fe602a3645f3f0d64cdd6.mp4?t=1774384440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a never-ending thinking-type puzzle game without stages or excessive effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When ropes of the same color are connected, they disappear, and the board is rearranged little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, the special rules test the player's judgment and foresight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/7b42391fd6c9884a243b466e40d66d3d.poster.avif?t=1774384440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/7b42391fd6c9884a243b466e40d66d3d.webm?t=1774384440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/7b42391fd6c9884a243b466e40d66d3d.mp4?t=1774384440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a game of thinking, making mistakes, learning, and getting better little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing flashy. There is only the essence of fun. For those who seek such puzzles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866170?t=1774384440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866170?t=1774384440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/9f3970b50ef2c55f3c906c448544e30d57c35ff2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774384440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/9f3970b50ef2c55f3c906c448544e30d57c35ff2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774384440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4329270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting and erasing ropes...that's all there is to this pure puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/e0f2f545599fe602a3645f3f0d64cdd6.poster.avif?t=1774384440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/e0f2f545599fe602a3645f3f0d64cdd6.webm?t=1774384440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866170/extras/e0f2f545599fe602a3645f3f0d64cdd6.mp4?t=1774384440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a never-ending thinking-type puzzle game without stages or excessive effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When ropes of the same color are connected, they disappear, and the board is rearranged little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On t